}

### Text Classification - Technology
POST http://localhost:8080/api/classify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "This new smartphone has amazing battery life and 5G connectivity",
  "categories": ["technology", "food", "sports", "politics"]
}

### Text Classification - Food
POST http://localhost:8080/api/classify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "I love eating pizza and pasta with fresh mozzarella",
  "categories": ["food", "technology", "sports"]
}

### Text Classification - Custom Categories
POST http://localhost:8080/api/classify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "The company reported strong quarterly earnings",
  "categories": ["business", "sports", "entertainment", "politics"]
}